WEBVTT

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:31.000
and there is still
not a functioning website.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.816
"You guys realize,
the entire company is a website.

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.200
That's literally all it is."

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:40.440
So I obviously declined to invest.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.896
And they ended up
naming the company Warby Parker.

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:45.536
(Laughter)

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.320
They sell glasses online.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:51.696
They were recently recognized
as the world's most innovative company

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:53.736
and valued at over a billion dollars.

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:57.080
And now? My wife handles our investments.

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:00.520
Why was I so wrong?